{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8f08d94d-f651-8407-ab7a-87516ed5682e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T10:57:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sean Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:54:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:54:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Yes, I need a new recycling bin, please. Mine is, um, it is broken. The bottom crack and the lid is gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:54:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a replacement recycling bin. Sure, we can do that. Can I get the address where it's going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:54:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 265 Harrison Avenue. Over on the Fort Adams side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:54:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two sixty-five Harrison. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:54:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sean Lynch. L-Y-N-C-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:54:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, Mr. Lynch. So what happened with the old one, did it crack in the cold or did the truck grab it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:55:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think the cold, and then it is not picked up. They leave it there. The crew skip my recycling this week, and last week also. Is the second time in a row they miss."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:55:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so two pickups missed in a row. Let me write that down. Second miss, Harrison Avenue. Was the bin out at the curb both times?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:55:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, out early, before seven. Same place, by the end of the driveway. I think maybe they see the bin broken and they say, no, we don't take."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:55:36-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That could be it. Sometimes if a bin's cracked up they'll pass on it. I'll put a note in for the missed pickups and a request for the new bin. Let me just pull up the form here, give me a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:55:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no problem. I am happy to wait if you need a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:55:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, appreciate it. [pause] Okay, I'm in. Is it the regular size, the blue one with the wheels, or the smaller open one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:56:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The small one, the open one. Is what I had before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:56:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Small open bin. Okay. Now, once this is in, they'll bring it out to you. Usually that's a few business days, so you should see it by the end of the week or early next."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:56:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the recycling that is in the old one now? It is full, you know. What I do with that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:56:33-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Easiest thing, put it in a sturdy box or a bag next to the bin, and set it out on your next pickup day. Just keep it clean and dry. I'll note that on the request too, so the crew knows to take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:56:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that is good. A box, I can do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:56:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Let me read back what I've got. Sean Lynch, 265 Harrison Avenue, replacement small recycling bin, two missed pickups in a row. Do I have that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:57:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:57:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the number I have is the one you're calling from, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-four?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:57:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is my number. Landline."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:57:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. If anything changes, we'll call you there. You're all set, Mr. Lynch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:57:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you very much. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:57:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
